  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fourth Replenishment of the Inter-American Development Bank&apos;s Multilateral Investment Fund (MIF IV)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is the fourth replenishment of the Inter-American Development Bank Group&apos;s innovation and venture capital arm formally known as the Multilateral Investment Fund but also referred to at IDB Lab. IDB Lab, with its private sector innovation objective, will tighten strategic focus, increase ambitions for women and girls, climate, poverty, and the Caribbean, while moving to a more sustainable funding model.</narrative>
  </description>
